# Architecture Kit ({{projectName}})

This repo uses **@folklore/architecture-kit** (private, versioned git dependency).

- **Default:** `node_modules/@folklore/architecture-kit` — updated on `npm run dev` / `build-dev`
- **Local kit dev:** `export ARCHITECTURE_KIT_LOCAL=1` → uses `../architecture-kit` first

- Config: `architecture.config.json`
- Docs source: `docs/architecture/`, `docs/adr/`, `docs/diagrams/`
- Docs site (built): `public/architecture/` → served at `/architecture/` (Next.js embed)
- AI entrypoint: `docs/architecture/ai-context.md`

## Commands

```bash
npm run dev                    # predev rebuilds docs site
npm run build-dev              # docs + production Next build
npm run architecture:validate
npm run architecture:doctor
npm run architecture:site:build
```

Kit releases: bump version + tag in **architecture-kit** only. Host repos pick up new tags via semver on build.

## Scope hints for agents

- Kit/template/validator changes → **architecture-kit** repo (release new version)
- Application code → **this project** repo
- Say explicitly when a task is docs-only vs code-only
